  "content": "<p>HAX began in teaching and learning, so many blocks check understanding, not just show content. Answer these; the theme keeps track of what you finish.</p>\n<h2>Check what you know</h2>\n<true-false-question question=\"Every block on this page also works outside of the HAX editor.\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"True\" data-correct=\"true\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"False\"></true-false-question>\n<multiple-choice question=\"Which of these can you add to a HAX page?\" correct-text=\"Yes, all of them.\" incorrect-text=\"Not quite: try another.\" check-label=\"Check answer\" reset-label=\"Reset\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"A video\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"A quiz\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"A data table\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"A pixel-art character\"></multiple-choice>\n<mark-the-words question=\"Select every web component name in this sentence\" statement=\"Add a video-player and a grid-plate to the page.\" max-attempts=\"0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"video-player\"><input type=\"checkbox\" value=\"grid-plate\"></mark-the-words>\n<h2>Lay things out</h2>\n<grid-plate layout=\"1-1\">\n  <div slot=\"col-1\">\n    <h3>Two columns</h3>\n    <p>This is a <code>grid-plate</code>. Drag blocks between its columns or pick another layout in its settings.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div slot=\"col-2\">\n    <rpg-character seed=\"try-hax\" walking=\"\"></rpg-character>\n    <p>And this is <a href=\"https://rpg-me.hax.cloud\">rpg-character</a>. Build your own at RPG me.</p>\n  </div>\n</grid-plate>\n<h2>Show data</h2>\n<editable-table bordered=\"\" striped=\"\" column-header=\"\">\n  <table>\n    <caption>Blocks on this page</caption>\n    <tbody><tr><th>Block</th><th>What it does</th></tr>\n    <tr><td>true-false-question</td><td>A quick true or false check</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>multiple-choice</td><td>One or more correct answers</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>mark-the-words</td><td>Pick the right words in a sentence</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>grid-plate</td><td>Columns for any blocks</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>editable-table</td><td>This table, sortable and editable</td></tr>\n  </tbody></table>\n</editable-table>\n<p>See every block, with demos, in the <a href=\"https://webcomponents.hax.cloud\">element portfolio</a>.</p>"
}